# Working material: LinkedIn post drafts and event photography, kept out of the
# build. These are the unprocessed originals — camera-resolution photos and
# unedited text — and the site never reads them. What the site actually uses is
# the edited, published form committed under src/content/<collection>/<slug>/
# and public/. docs/PUBLICATIONS_SOURCE.md is the record of which of these were
# used, which were not, and why.
/images/
